{%- comment -%}
  PURELANE — PRODUCT CARD
  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  The card from the "Loved by 30,000 homes" shelf, rebuilt against real
  products. Extracted as a snippet because the shelf is not the only place a
  product card belongs — the same component serves any future collection or
  recommendation section without a second implementation.

  Production issues fixed here that the prototype could not have had:

  - The prototype's cards linked nowhere. A storefront product card that does
    not reach the product page is broken commerce, so the title and image now
    link to product.url. The image link is removed from the tab order and
    hidden from assistive tech so it is not a duplicate stop announcing the
    same destination twice.

  - "Add to cart" was a dead <button>. It is now a real product form, so it
    works with JavaScript disabled and goes through Dawn's own cart. Products
    with more than one variant link to the product page instead, because a
    card cannot express a variant choice.

  - Sold-out products get a disabled control and a badge. The prototype had no
    inventory to be out of.

  - Long titles are clamped to three lines so one long product name cannot
    push its card taller than the rest of the row. All three states are in the
    seeded catalogue on purpose.

  Accepts:
    product      object   required
    reveal_delay string   optional, e.g. 'pl-rv--d1'
    sizes        string   optional, passed to the media snippet
    loading      string   optional, 'lazy' (default) or 'eager'
    heading_level string  optional, defaults to 'h3'

  Usage:
    {% render 'purelane-product-card', product: card_product, reveal_delay: 'pl-rv--d1' %}
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign delay = reveal_delay | default: ''
  assign card_sizes = sizes | default: '(min-width: 860px) 260px, 44vw'
  assign img_loading = loading | default: 'lazy'
  assign level = heading_level | default: 'h3'

  assign badge = product.metafields.purelane.badge.value
  assign available = product.available
  assign single_variant = false
  if product.variants.size == 1
    assign single_variant = true
  endif
-%}

<article class="pl-glass pl-card pl-rv {{ delay }}">

  <a
    class="pl-card__shot"
    href="{{ product.url }}"
    tabindex="-1"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
    {%- if badge != blank -%}
      <span class="pl-card__badge">{{ badge }}</span>
    {%- elsif available == false -%}
      <span class="pl-card__badge pl-card__badge--out">Sold out</span>
    {%- endif -%}

    {% render 'purelane-product-media',
      product: product,
      class: 'pl-card__img',
      sizes: card_sizes,
      loading: img_loading
    %}
  </a>

  {%- case level -%}
    {%- when 'h2' -%}
      <h2 class="pl-card__title"><a href="{{ product.url }}">{{ product.title }}</a></h2>
    {%- when 'h4' -%}
      <h4 class="pl-card__title"><a href="{{ product.url }}">{{ product.title }}</a></h4>
    {%- else -%}
      <h3 class="pl-card__title"><a href="{{ product.url }}">{{ product.title }}</a></h3>
  {%- endcase -%}

  {% render 'purelane-rating', product: product, class: 'pl-card__rate' %}

  {% render 'purelane-price', product: product, class: 'pl-card__price' %}

  {%- if available == false -%}

    <button type="button" class="pl-btn pl-btn--ghost pl-btn--sm pl-btn--block" disabled>
      Sold out
    </button>

  {%- elsif single_variant -%}

    {%- form 'product', product, class: 'pl-card__form' -%}
      <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}">
      <button type="submit" name="add" class="pl-btn pl-btn--ghost pl-btn--sm pl-btn--block">
        Add to cart
        <span class="pl-visually-hidden">, {{ product.title }}</span>
      </button>
    {%- endform -%}

  {%- else -%}

    {%- comment -%}
      More than one variant: a card cannot express the choice, so send the
      shopper to the product page rather than silently adding a default.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="pl-btn pl-btn--ghost pl-btn--sm pl-btn--block">
      Choose options
      <span class="pl-visually-hidden">for {{ product.title }}</span>
    </a>

  {%- endif -%}

</article>
